{"frame":{"type":"chunk","attemptId":"session-aa2436c4-2fac-4aca-ae05-b8991b121683:2","revision":19,"index":8,"time":1792480947515,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"text","text":"**快速排序**采用分治法：选一个基准元素，把数组分成小于和大于基准的两部分，再递归排序。\n\n```ts\nexport function quickSort(a: number[]): number[] {\n  if (a.length <= 1) return a\n  const [pivot, ...rest] = a\n  return [\n    ...quickSort(rest.filter(x => x < pivot)),\n    pivot,\n    ...quickSort(rest.filter(x => x >= pivot)),\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n平均时间复杂度 O(n log n)，最坏 O(n²)；实现简单，常用于内省排序的基础。"}}}}
